  "intro_html": "<p>The <strong>Risetestock</strong> (1758 m) is a western outcrop of the <strong>Pilatus</strong> range, rising above the small hamlet of Gfellen in the Entlebuch. The SAC-rated T4 traverse from Gfellen to Blaue Tosse crosses exposed terrain opposite the Schimberig, with 820 m of ascent through steep alpine ground.</p>",
