    "by_pt_html": "<ul><li>Train to <strong>Schüpfheim</strong> (BLS Entlebuch line from Bern or Luzern).</li><li>PostBus to <strong>Gfellen</strong> (Finsterwald b. Entlebuch).</li><li>Plan via <a href=\"https://www.sbb.ch/en\" target=\"_blank\">sbb.ch</a>.</li></ul>",
    "by_car_html": "<p>Drive to <strong>Gfellen</strong> (6162 Finsterwald b. Entlebuch) via Schüpfheim or Entlebuch. Limited parking at the hamlet.</p>"
